{"id":"654081","name":"腌生姜","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/654081/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"子姜","amount":"1000g"}],"sub":[{"name":"糖","amount":"100g"},{"name":"黄冰糖","amount":"10g"},{"name":"白醋","amount":"半碗"},{"name":"白酒","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"子姜清洗干净后刮去外皮，沥干水分。","img":"images/654081/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切片。","img":"images/654081/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"生姜装入盆内，放入糖和白醋。","img":"images/654081/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"搅拌均匀，放至半小时。","img":"images/654081/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"生姜泡软后放入无油无水干净的密封罐里。","img":"images/654081/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"表面再撒入黄冰糖，倒适量白酒封面即可。","img":"images/654081/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"存放冰箱，腌制两三天后即可食用。","img":"images/654081/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}